      "summaries": {
        "en": "fff is a high-performance file search toolkit optimized for AI agents, Neovim, and multiple programming languages. Its core innovation is a hybrid algorithm combining fuzzy matching with exact substring search, achieving both speed and accuracy. Built in Rust, it offers native bindings for C, Node.js, and Lua. Use it to supercharge file navigation in Neovim, build fast file-finding tools, or integrate into AI workflows that require rapid, precise file retrieval.",
        "zh": "fff 是一个专为 AI 代理、Neovim 及多种编程语言优化的高性能文件搜索工具包。其核心技术亮点是混合算法，将模糊匹配与精确子串搜索巧妙结合，在保证速度的同时大幅提升搜索准确性。项目采用 Rust 编写，提供 C、Node.js 和 Lua 的原生绑定，易于集成。你可以用它来加速 Neovim 中的文件导航，构建快速文件查找工具，或将其嵌入 AI 工作流中，实现毫秒级的精准文件检索。",
        "es": "fff is a high-performance file search toolkit optimized for AI agents, Neovim, and multiple programming languages. Its core innovation is a hybrid algorithm combining fuzzy matching with exact substring search, achieving both speed and accuracy. Built in Rust, it offers native bindings for C, Node.js, and Lua. Use it to supercharge file navigation in Neovim, build fast file-finding tools, or integrate into AI workflows that require rapid, precise file retrieval.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "fff stands out for filesearch, lua, and neovim in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "fff is a high-performance file search toolkit optimized for AI agents, Neovim, and multiple programming languages. Its core innovation is a hybrid algorithm combining fuzzy matching with exact substring search, achieving both speed and accuracy. Built in Rust, it offers native bindings for C, Node.js, and Lua. Use it to supercharge file navigation in Neovim, build fast file-finding tools, or integrate into AI workflows that require rapid, precise file retrieval.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/dmtrKovalenko/fff for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
