      "summaries": {
        "en": "Whisper-base is OpenAI's compact automatic speech recognition model, designed for efficient multilingual transcription and translation. Its key innovation is training on 680k hours of weakly supervised data, enabling robust performance across 96 languages with a single architecture. You can use it via Hugging Face Transformers for real-time transcription, fine-tune it for domain-specific vocabulary, or deploy it on edge devices for offline speech-to-text.",
        "zh": "Whisper-base是OpenAI的轻量级自动语音识别模型，基于68万小时弱监督数据训练，支持96种语言，在嘈杂环境下鲁棒性高。采用编码器-解码器Transformer结构，通过多任务输出（语言检测、时间戳、转录文本）实现端到端处理。可集成于Hugging Face Transformers用于实时字幕，或针对医疗、法律等专业领域微调，也可部署于边缘设备实现离线语音转文字。该模型在准确性与速度间取得平衡，适合构建语音应用。",
        "es": "Whisper-base is OpenAI's compact automatic speech recognition model, designed for efficient multilingual transcription and translation. Its key innovation is training on 680k hours of weakly supervised data, enabling robust performance across 96 languages with a single architecture. You can use it via Hugging Face Transformers for real-time transcription, fine-tune it for domain-specific vocabulary, or deploy it on edge devices for offline speech-to-text.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "whisper-base stands out for transformers, pytorch, and tf in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Whisper-base is OpenAI's compact automatic speech recognition model, designed for efficient multilingual transcription and translation. Its key innovation is training on 680k hours of weakly supervised data, enabling robust performance across 96 languages with a single architecture. You can use it via Hugging Face Transformers for real-time transcription, fine-tune it for domain-specific vocabulary, or deploy it on edge devices for offline speech-to-text.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-base for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
